				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone, welcome to my blog! 🔥🚀&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am a marketer with 11 years of professional experience in the industry. Throughout my career, I have witnessed how fast the digital landscape changes, but recently, I realized something even more profound: &lt;em&gt;AI is no longer just a tool—it is the future of everything we do.&lt;/em&gt; Driven by this realization and a strong desire to stay ahead of the curve, I decided to take a bold leap. I joined &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;이어드림스쿨&amp;rdquo; (Eardream School)&lt;/em&gt; to immerse myself in the world of Artificial Intelligence from the ground up. 😊&lt;/p&gt;</description>
